---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Announcing SpareTank 1.0 • SpareTank Blog">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16">
    <a href="/blog" class="text-sm font-semibold text-brand-emerald hover:underline mb-8 inline-block">
      ← Back to News &amp; Releases
    </a>

    <header class="mb-10 space-y-3">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-xs font-mono text-muted">
        <span>September 24, 2026</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span class="text-brand-emerald font-semibold">Release 1.0.0</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Announcing SpareTank 1.0: Battery Longevity &amp; Reserve Protection
      </h1>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-6 text-main/90 leading-relaxed text-base">
      <p>
        Today, Tekromancy is pleased to announce the closed testing release of <strong>SpareTank</strong> on Google Play, with <strong>SpareTank Pro</strong> coming soon!
      </p>

      <p>
        Modern lithium-ion smartphone batteries lose up to 30% of their capacity within 18 months primarily due to two factors: deep discharge down to 0% and high-voltage saturation from charging to 100% overnight. Furthermore, users frequently misplace their phone or leave it unattended in bags, only to find the battery completely dead when they need it most.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-emerald pt-4">🌟 Core Highlights in 1.0</h2>

      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-muted">
        <li><strong class="text-main">25% – 75% Longevity Guard:</strong> Active heads-up notifications alerting you when it is time to plug in or unplug.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-main">The "Spare Tank" Reserve Floor:</strong> If your phone hits 15% charge unattended, a high-priority countdown triggers before auto-powering down, guaranteeing reserve power.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-main">Interactive Heads-Up Alert:</strong> Tap "Keep Awake" with a single click if you are actively using your phone to continue normal usage.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-main">Multi-Tier Shutdown Engine:</strong> Supports Root (`su`), elevated wireless ADB (`Shizuku`), and assistive power dialogs on unrooted devices.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-emerald pt-4">📦 Free vs Pro Editions</h2>
      <p>
        SpareTank is distributed in two builds:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-muted">
        <li><strong>SpareTank: Battery Longevity (Free):</strong> Currently in closed testing on Google Play with non-intrusive AdMob banner support.</li>
        <li><strong>SpareTank Pro: Battery Guard (Coming Soon):</strong> 100% ad-free, completely excludes all advertising SDKs for minimal memory footprint. Scheduled for release following the free edition closed beta.</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="mt-12 p-6 rounded-xl bg-card border border-border-hover">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-2">Ready to test SpareTank?</h3>
        <p class="text-muted text-sm mb-4">Join our closed testing track directly on Google Play today.</p>
        <a href="/#download" class="inline-flex px-6 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-brand-emerald text-black font-bold text-sm">
          Join Closed Beta
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
